   "text": "חשבו: \\[\\int\\frac{4x^2+3x+3}{(x+1)(x^2+1)}\\,dx\\]",
   "topic": "אינטגרלים",
   "sub": "שיטות אינטגרציה",
   "solution": {
    "official": false,
    "steps": [
     "פירוק: \\(\\frac{4x^2+3x+3}{(x+1)(x^2+1)}=\\frac{A}{x+1}+\\frac{Bx+C}{x^2+1}\\). \\(x=-1\\): \\(4=2A\\Rightarrow A=2\\).",
     "מקדם \\(x^2\\): \\(4=A+B\\Rightarrow B=2\\); מקדם חופשי: \\(3=A+C\\Rightarrow C=1\\).",
     "\\(\\int\\left(\\frac2{x+1}+\\frac{2x}{x^2+1}+\\frac1{x^2+1}\\right)dx=2\\ln|x+1|+\\ln(x^2+1)+\\arctan x+C\\)."
    ],
    "answer": "\\(2\\ln|x+1|+\\ln(x^2+1)+\\arctan x+C\\)"
   }
  },
